    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[JBIG2 image compression]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/Fyrd/caniuse/issues/7513</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/Fyrd/caniuse/issues/7513"/>
        <updated>2026-08-19T11:53:42.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12958815?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><blockquote>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JBIG2" rel="nofollow">JBIG2</a> is an image compression standard for bi-level images, developed by the Joint Bi-level Image Experts Group. It is suitable for both lossless and lossy compression. According to a press release from the Group, in its lossless mode JBIG2 typically generates files 3–5 times smaller than <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Group_4_compression" rel="nofollow">Fax Group 4</a> and 2–4 times smaller than JBIG, the previous bi-level compression standard released by the Group. JBIG2 was published in 2000 as the international standard ITU T.88, and in 2001 as ISO/IEC 14492.</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 dir="auto"></h2>
<h3 dir="auto">why</h3>
<p dir="auto">see also</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="328060355" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/Fyrd/caniuse/issues/4281" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/Fyrd/caniuse/issues/4281/hovercard?comment_id=4275274227&amp;comment_type=issue_comment" href="https://github.com/Fyrd/caniuse/issues/4281#issuecomment-4275274227">#4281 (comment)</a></li>
</ul>
<h2 dir="auto">polyfills</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://github.com/milahu/jbig2-polyfill">https://github.com/milahu/jbig2-polyfill</a></li>
</ul>]]></content>
